            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>ServiceID (unsignedShort)</td><td>ServiceName</td><td>Description</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>AC</td><td>AC energy transfer, physical layer according to ISO 15118-3 and ISO 15118-8</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>DC</td><td>DC energy transfer, physical layer according to ISO 15118-3 and ISO 15118-8</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>WPT</td><td>WPT, physical layer according to ISO 15118-8</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>DC_ACDP</td><td>DC Charging with ACDP, physical layer according to ISO 15118-8</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>AC_BPT</td><td>AC Charging with BPT, physical layer according to ISO 15118-3 and ISO 15118-8</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>DC_BPT</td><td>DC Charging with BPT, physical layer according to ISO 15118-3 and ISO 15118-8</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>DC_ACDP_BPT</td><td>DC Charging with ACDP and BPT, physical layer according to ISO 15118-8</td></tr><tr><td>8-64</td><td></td><td>Reserved by this document</td></tr><tr><td>65</td><td>Internet</td><td>Service for standard protocols like HTTP, HTTPS, FTP, etc. Refer to 8.4.3.2.6 for further details</td></tr><tr><td>66</td><td>ParkingStatus</td><td>service for approach and departure of EV</td></tr><tr><td>67 - 32767</td><td></td><td>Reserved by this document</td></tr><tr><td>32768 - 65535</td><td></td><td>reserved for implementation specific use</td></tr></table>",
